5) Gazebo models under models/
   Some models were obtained from public collections listed in models/README
   (gazebo-classic worlds, osrf/gazebo_models, and others). Where a model
   originates from OSRF's gazebo_models it is distributed under CC-BY-3.0
   (the repository LICENSE reads "Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported",
   Copyright 2012 Nathan Koenig) and attribution is required. Models fetched
   from the Gazebo Fuel model database may carry different terms; check each.
   Note that the CC-BY-3.0 above is the repository-level license of
   osrf/gazebo_models; upstream acknowledges that the provenance of some
   individual models is not fully documented, so verify per model before
   redistributing any of them.
   The 20 model directories committed here that are NOT prefixed
   aws_robomaker_ (box, brick, chair, monitor, table, test, test_layout,
   test_wall, test_world, stairs, testbed_floor1, testbed_floor2,
   door_steel_round, gray_brick_pile and guardrail_*) appear to have been
   authored for this project rather than taken from those collections: their
   Collada files were exported from Blender 4.5.3 in October 2025 and their
   textures are original photographs. They are not referenced by any world in
   this repository. Their copyright holder is not recorded in the files.

